    {
      "parameters": {
        "promptType": "define",
        "text": "=You are matching freelance projects to one specific freelancer.\n\nFREELANCER PROFILE:\n{{ $('Extract Skill Profile').first().json.text }}\n\nPROJECTS TO SCORE (JSON array):\n{{ JSON.stringify($json.jobs.map(j => ({url: j.url, title: j.title, skills: j.skills, budget_usd_max: j.budget_usd_max}))) }}\n\nFor EVERY project in the array, score from 0 to 100 how well it fits this freelancer, and give one short sentence of reasoning.\n\nScoring rules:\n- 80-100: squarely in their core skills\n- 50-79: adjacent, they could do it with some stretch\n- 20-49: weak overlap\n- 0-19: wrong field entirely\nBe honest and be willing to give low scores. A project needing skills this freelancer does not have MUST score below 20. Do not credit them with skills absent from the profile.\n\nReturn ONLY a valid JSON array, no markdown fences, one object per project:\n[{\"url\": \"...\", \"title\": \"...\", \"score\": 0, \"reason\": \"...\"}]"
      },
      "id": "abbffde0-8126-4afc-afc0-62398994c0ad",
      "name": "Score Jobs vs Profile",
      "type": "@n8n/n8n-nodes-langchain.chainLlm",
      "typeVersion": 1.6,
      "position": [
        1184,
        -240
      ]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "jsCode": "// Parse the scoring step's JSON, sort by score, keep the best 5.\nlet raw = $input.first().json.text ?? $input.first().json.output ?? '';\nraw = String(raw).replace(/```json/gi, '').replace(/```/g, '').trim();\n\nlet scored;\ntry {\n  scored = JSON.parse(raw);\n} catch (e) {\n  throw new Error('Scoring step did not return valid JSON. First 300 chars: ' + raw.slice(0, 300));\n}\n\nif (!Array.isArray(scored)) {\n  throw new Error('Scoring step returned ' + typeof scored + ', expected an array.');\n}\n\nscored.sort((a, b) => (b.score ?? 0) - (a.score ?? 0));\n\nreturn [{\n  json: {\n    top: scored.slice(0, 5),\n    total_scored: scored.length,\n    best_score: scored[0]?.score ?? null,\n    worst_score: scored[scored.length - 1]?.score ?? null,\n  }\n}];\n"
      },
      "id": "ed2b843e-7290-44f3-a37a-72800df571d6",
      "name": "Rank and Take Top 5",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.code",
      "typeVersion": 2,
      "position": [
        1392,
        -240
      ]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "promptType": "define",
        "text": "=Write a short application pitch for each freelance project below, written in the voice of the freelancer.\n\nFREELANCER PROFILE:\n{{ $('Extract Skill Profile').first().json.text }}\n\nTOP PROJECTS:\n{{ JSON.stringify($json.top) }}\n\nFor each project write 3-4 sentences that:\n- open with the specific, relevant experience for THAT project\n- reference only skills and projects actually present in the profile\n- state concretely what you would do first\n- avoid greetings, sign-offs, and filler like \"I am excited\"\n\nNever invent experience the profile does not contain.\n\nReturn ONLY a valid JSON array, no markdown fences:\n[{\"title\": \"...\", \"url\": \"...\", \"score\": 0, \"pitch\": \"...\"}]"
      },
      "id": "fd17783f-4aa5-45cf-bc1e-195550467b82",
      "name": "Write Pitches",
      "type": "@n8n/n8n-nodes-langchain.chainLlm",
      "typeVersion": 1.6,
      "position": [
        1584,
        -240
      ]
    },
    {
